{"id":"kazhetsya","lemma":"кажется","pos":"other","rank":135,"glosses":["apparently, it seems","maybe"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%81%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он кажется хорошим человеком.","en":"He seems like a good person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653969","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Кажется, ты хороший.","en":"You seem nice.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"good, nice, fine"}]},{"text":"Кажется, он нас знает.","en":"He seems to know us.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Кажется, это серьезно.","en":"It seems to be serious.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Вы, кажется, понимаете.","en":"You seem to understand.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to understand","l":"понимать"}]}]}